    <div id="english" lang="en" style="color: var(--text-body); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8;">
      <h2 style="font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 28px; color: var(--walnut); margin: 0 0 16px;">Privacy Policy (English)</h2>

      <p>This notice explains how personal data is handled when you visit <strong>mychoicecabinet.com</strong> (the &ldquo;Website&rdquo;) or contact us about kitchen cabinets. It is provided under the Personal Data Protection Act 2010 of Malaysia (&ldquo;PDPA&rdquo;). A Bahasa Malaysia version follows below.</p>

      <h3 style="font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 21px; color: var(--walnut); margin: 28px 0 10px;">1. Who we are</h3>
      <p>The Website is operated by <strong>{{ privacy.facts.legalEntityName }}</strong>, trading as {{ site.name }} (&ldquo;we&rdquo;, &ldquo;us&rdquo;).<br>
      Address: {{ site.address.streetAddress }}, {{ site.address.postalCode }} {{ site.address.addressLocality }}, {{ site.address.addressRegion }}, Malaysia.<br>
      Telephone: <a href="tel:{{ site.phone }}">+60 17-836 0455</a> &middot; Email: <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a></p>

      <h3 style="font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 21px; color: var(--walnut); margin: 28px 0 10px;">2. What personal data we collect and how</h3>
      <p><strong>(a) Information you give us when you enquire.</strong> The Website has no online forms. If you contact us for a quotation, you do so by WhatsApp message, telephone call or email. Depending on what you choose to share, this may include your name, telephone number, email address, the address or area of your home, kitchen measurements, photos or floor plans, and your preferences and budget. Clicking a WhatsApp link on the Website opens the WhatsApp app with a pre-written message that you can edit before sending.</p>
      <p><strong>(b) Information collected automatically.</strong> When you visit the Website, our analytics tool (Google Analytics 4) collects usage information such as the pages you view, the device, browser and approximate location from which you visit, and how you arrived at the Website. The Website also records when a WhatsApp, telephone or email link is clicked, as an analytics event; it does not record the content of your message or call. Google Analytics may use cookies or similar technologies for this purpose.</p>
      <p><strong>(c) Technical data.</strong> Our hosting provider ({{ privacy.facts.hostingProvider }}) processes technical information needed to deliver the Website, such as your IP address, browser type and the pages requested, and may keep server logs for security and reliability.</p>
      <p><strong>(d) Cookies and storage of the Website itself.</strong> The Website's own code does not set cookies or use browser local storage. Choosing a language adds a <code>?lang=</code> parameter to the page address. Third-party services described below may set their own cookies.</p>
      <p>Providing personal data is voluntary. If you do not provide the information we need, we may be unable to prepare a quotation.</p>

      <h3 style="font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 21px; color: var(--walnut); margin: 28px 0 10px;">3. Why we use your data</h3>
      <ul style="padding-left: 24px;">
        <li>to respond to your enquiry and prepare design advice and quotations;</li>
        <li>to communicate with you about your enquiry or project (by WhatsApp, telephone or email);</li>
        <li>to understand how the Website is used and to improve it (analytics);</li>
        <li>to keep the Website secure and working properly; and</li>
        <li>to comply with legal obligations.</li>
      </ul>

      <h3 style="font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 21px; color: var(--walnut); margin: 28px 0 10px;">4. Third parties and international transfers</h3>
      <p>We use the following third-party services. They may process data outside Malaysia.</p>
      <ul style="padding-left: 24px;">
        <li><strong>Google Analytics 4 / Google Tag Manager</strong> (Google) &mdash; website analytics.</li>
        <li><strong>Google Fonts</strong> (Google) &mdash; your browser requests font files from Google when pages load, which discloses your IP address to Google.</li>
        <li><strong>Google Maps</strong> (Google) &mdash; a map embedded in the page footer; loading it discloses your IP address to Google.</li>
        <li><strong>WhatsApp</strong> (Meta) &mdash; if you contact us on WhatsApp, your messages are handled under WhatsApp's own terms and privacy policy.</li>
        <li><strong>{{ privacy.facts.hostingProvider }}</strong> &mdash; website hosting and delivery.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>The Website also links to our pages on Facebook, YouTube, LinkedIn and TikTok. Those platforms have their own privacy policies and only receive data about you if you click through to them.</p>
      <p>We do not sell your personal data. We do not disclose your enquiry details to other parties except where needed to provide our services (for example, to our installation team), or where required by law.</p>

      <h3 style="font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 21px; color: var(--walnut); margin: 28px 0 10px;">5. How long we keep your data</h3>
      <p><strong>Enquiry and project records:</strong> {{ privacy.facts.enquiryRetention }}<br>
      <strong>Analytics data:</strong> {{ privacy.facts.analyticsRetention }}</p>

      <h3 style="font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 21px; color: var(--walnut); margin: 28px 0 10px;">6. Your rights</h3>
      <p>Under the PDPA you may ask us to:</p>
      <ul style="padding-left: 24px;">
        <li>confirm whether we hold personal data about you and give you access to it;</li>
        <li>correct personal data that is inaccurate, incomplete or out of date;</li>
        <li>stop or limit our use of your personal data, and withdraw any consent you gave us; and</li>
        <li>stop using your data for direct marketing.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>To make a request, contact us at <a href="mailto:{{ privacy.facts.privacyContactEmail }}">{{ privacy.facts.privacyContactEmail }}</a> or {{ privacy.facts.privacyContactPhone }}. We may need to verify your identity first, and some requests may be limited as permitted by law. If you are not satisfied with our response, you may complain to the Personal Data Protection Commissioner of Malaysia (Jabatan Perlindungan Data Peribadi).</p>

      <h3 style="font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 21px; color: var(--walnut); margin: 28px 0 10px;">7. Managing analytics and cookies</h3>
      <p>You can block or delete cookies through your browser settings, or install Google's Analytics opt-out browser add-on. Doing so does not stop you from using the Website.</p>

      <h3 style="font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 21px; color: var(--walnut); margin: 28px 0 10px;">8. Changes to this notice</h3>
      <p>We may update this notice from time to time. The effective date above shows the latest version.</p>

      <h3 style="font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 21px; color: var(--walnut); margin: 28px 0 10px;">9. Language</h3>
      <p>This notice is provided in English and Bahasa Malaysia. If you would like help understanding it, contact us using the details above.</p>
